WEBVTT

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:37.700
Ryu-Oh's tree... it's getting so big already.

00:02:39.139 --> 00:02:43.410
Jurai's ships are very strong.

00:02:43.410 --> 00:02:48.939
They can live on a little soil
and water for thousands of years.

00:02:56.823 --> 00:02:59.726
I'm off to school now.

00:02:59.726 --> 00:03:01.318
You have a nice day, now.

00:03:02.662 --> 00:03:04.664
We'll see you when you get back.

00:03:04.664 --> 00:03:06.131
See you!

00:03:08.735 --> 00:03:12.372
Well, I guess we should
do some laundry, then.

00:03:12.372 --> 00:03:13.740
Okay.

00:03:13.740 --> 00:03:17.944
Huh? Ryoko? Where did she go?

00:03:17.944 --> 00:03:19.179
Huh?

00:03:19.179 --> 00:03:23.984
Geez! She's cutting the house chores again?

00:03:23.984 --> 00:03:29.251
She is a real parasite, isn't she?

00:03:33.126 --> 00:03:36.357
Ryoko, you should help the
others around the house sometimes.

00:03:38.598 --> 00:03:39.900
I suppose so.

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:43.537
I am sponging off you, aren't I?

00:03:43.537 --> 00:03:46.239
Ayeka must be really furious.

00:03:46.239 --> 00:03:47.741
Oh, let her.

00:03:47.741 --> 00:03:49.342
I don't give a damn about it.

00:03:49.342 --> 00:03:51.244
Oh, Ryoko.

00:03:51.244 --> 00:03:52.712
Tenchi, you know what?

00:03:52.712 --> 00:03:54.347
What is it?

00:03:54.347 --> 00:03:58.785
How long has it been
since Ayeka and I came here?

00:03:58.785 --> 00:04:01.021
Hmm. I'd say it's been
about 3 months or so.

00:04:01.021 --> 00:04:03.823
Really? Just 3 months, huh?

00:04:03.823 --> 00:04:05.518
I believe so.

00:04:07.394 --> 00:04:10.764
Tenchi... we are having fun, aren't we?

00:04:10.764 --> 00:04:13.289
Every day here is like a dream.

00:04:21.041 --> 00:04:25.145
I hope it's going to be like this forever.

00:04:25.145 --> 00:04:26.613
What?

00:04:26.613 --> 00:04:28.103
Tenchi...

00:04:40.827 --> 00:04:44.230
All right! Great!

00:04:44.230 --> 00:04:46.466
I'm getting a promotion!

00:04:46.466 --> 00:04:48.401
I can go back to headquarters!

00:04:48.401 --> 00:04:51.638
I've been waiting for this day for so long.

00:04:51.638 --> 00:04:53.340
I know.

00:04:53.340 --> 00:04:55.642
It's great news, Kiyone.

00:04:55.642 --> 00:04:58.979
Finally, my luck is turning.

00:04:58.979 --> 00:05:01.413
I'm so glad I didn't give up my
career as a Galaxy Police officer.

00:05:02.549 --> 00:05:05.552
Oh, Kiyone.

00:05:05.552 --> 00:05:09.089
What are you doing, Mihoshi?

00:05:09.089 --> 00:05:12.492
Getting ready to go back
to headquarters, of course.

00:05:12.492 --> 00:05:15.095
They are taking me back, not you.

00:05:15.095 --> 00:05:16.585
What?

00:05:17.430 --> 00:05:19.833
No!

00:05:19.833 --> 00:05:24.004
They can't do this to me!
What am I gonna do without you?

00:05:24.004 --> 00:05:25.538
You'll be fine.

00:05:25.538 --> 00:05:29.943
In this place there won't be
anything too big for you to handle.

00:05:29.943 --> 00:05:32.112
Let's see...

00:05:32.112 --> 00:05:35.615
Ah, those paper flowers
need to be turned in this week.

00:05:35.615 --> 00:05:37.984
Otherwise, you won't get paid until next month.

00:05:37.984 --> 00:05:43.047
About my cheesecake in the
fridge, you can go ahead and eat it.

00:05:44.391 --> 00:05:46.192
Don't leave me, Kiyone!

00:05:46.192 --> 00:05:47.961
Whoa! Mihoshi, give that back to me.

00:05:47.961 --> 00:05:49.562
No, you can't go alone!

00:05:49.562 --> 00:05:53.133
I've already received an official
announcement of appointment, you know?

00:05:53.133 --> 00:05:54.367
No! No! No! No! No!

00:05:54.367 --> 00:05:57.771
Cut it out. Don't be a crybaby.

00:05:57.771 --> 00:05:59.466
No!

00:06:00.507 --> 00:06:03.743
Give me my suitcase back!

00:06:03.743 --> 00:06:06.146
No!

00:06:06.146 --> 00:06:07.636
Whoa!

00:06:18.525 --> 00:06:21.795
Hmm, you are going back to the
Galaxy Police headquarters, huh?

00:06:21.795 --> 00:06:25.699
My request for transfer was finally approved.

00:06:25.699 --> 00:06:28.201
It's a promotion, isn't it?

00:06:28.201 --> 00:06:31.871
Everyone, thank you for everything.

00:06:31.871 --> 00:06:34.240
I am so happy for you, Kiyone.

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:39.079
Uh-huh. I can start my
life anew without Mihoshi.

00:06:39.079 --> 00:06:41.815
I'm feeling so overwhelmed.

00:06:41.815 --> 00:06:44.150
I know how you must feel.

00:06:44.150 --> 00:06:48.644
But we are gonna miss you, Kiyone.

00:06:51.925 --> 00:06:54.587
I can't live without Kiyone!

00:07:13.913 --> 00:07:15.847
Wh-What is that?

00:07:26.993 --> 00:07:29.655
My house is gone!

00:07:35.168 --> 00:07:38.331
Ryo-Ohki, tell me what happened.

00:07:40.006 --> 00:07:42.372
I can't understand you!

00:07:43.409 --> 00:07:45.570
Calm down and talk.

00:07:47.413 --> 00:07:49.847
Aw, this is hopeless.

00:07:50.283 --> 00:07:51.351
Tenchi!

00:07:51.351 --> 00:07:53.286
Oh, Grandpa.

00:07:53.286 --> 00:07:55.255
Are you okay?

00:07:55.255 --> 00:07:56.623
What the heck is going on?

00:07:56.623 --> 00:08:00.760
I don't know. I was over at the shrine, so...

00:08:00.760 --> 00:08:02.250
Huh?

00:08:05.498 --> 00:08:07.022
Huh?

00:08:12.672 --> 00:08:14.765
Wh-What is that thing?

00:08:24.050 --> 00:08:25.118
Ow.

00:08:25.118 --> 00:08:27.678
That was a rough ride.

00:08:31.758 --> 00:08:33.419
Guys!

00:08:35.461 --> 00:08:38.021
What is all this?

00:08:39.632 --> 00:08:43.603
They totally caught this genius off guard!

00:08:43.603 --> 00:08:47.040
I will have to get back at them!

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:49.909
What happened? Tell me!

00:08:49.909 --> 00:08:52.343
Hold on a minute. I'll tell you all about it.

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:54.714
What?

00:08:54.714 --> 00:08:57.417
Where is Ayeka? Ryoko isn't here either.

00:08:57.417 --> 00:09:00.453
Sasami is missing, too.

00:09:00.453 --> 00:09:02.789
Where are those three?

00:09:02.789 --> 00:09:05.525
I said I'll tell you in a minute.

00:09:05.525 --> 00:09:07.823
To make a long story short...

00:09:15.635 --> 00:09:20.306
We all found ourselves in a spaceship
including your house and everything.

00:09:20.306 --> 00:09:23.935
It was the Planet Jurai's military.

00:09:25.111 --> 00:09:26.846
Jurai's military?

00:09:26.846 --> 00:09:28.581
This is rude behavior.

00:09:28.581 --> 00:09:31.718
Do you realize I am the crown
princess of Jurai's royal family?

00:09:31.718 --> 00:09:36.222
I guess the Council must have ordered
you to bring me back to the Planet Jurai.

00:09:36.222 --> 00:09:39.325
But I have already told them that
I was going to stay away for a while.

00:09:39.325 --> 00:09:45.098
Your Highness, I'm afraid that bringing
you back home was not our intention.

00:09:45.098 --> 00:09:47.367
What do you want, then?

00:09:47.367 --> 00:09:50.136
We've come to arrest you, Your Highness.

00:09:50.136 --> 00:09:52.104
To arrest me?

00:09:56.376 --> 00:09:59.746
Ah, you must be joking.
What are the charges, anyway?

00:09:59.746 --> 00:10:01.981
You are charged with
high treason, Your Highness.

00:10:01.981 --> 00:10:04.006
It can't be!

00:10:06.419 --> 00:10:11.891
That's why only the
four of us were sent back.

00:10:11.891 --> 00:10:16.419
Look what happened to our house.

00:10:18.464 --> 00:10:19.899
Are you telling me this is our house?

00:10:19.899 --> 00:10:23.670
I'm glad that they gave it back to us, but...

00:10:23.670 --> 00:10:28.074
It was compressed down into a portable size.

00:10:28.074 --> 00:10:29.776
I don't believe this!

00:10:29.776 --> 00:10:33.542
Check out Azaka and Kamidake here.

00:10:37.450 --> 00:10:38.484
Sasami!

00:10:38.484 --> 00:10:40.653
Sasami! What happened to her?

00:10:40.653 --> 00:10:44.958
She is considered to be
a partner in the rebellion.

00:10:44.958 --> 00:10:47.859
So they took her into custody also.

00:10:49.996 --> 00:10:51.597
What about Ryoko, then?

00:10:51.597 --> 00:10:53.099
Well, Ryoko was...

00:10:53.099 --> 00:10:56.202
What? You cannot arrest me!

00:10:56.202 --> 00:10:58.771
There must be some
kind of misunderstanding.

00:10:58.771 --> 00:11:00.340
Hey, Ayeka, my dear...

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:02.075
Huh?

00:11:02.075 --> 00:11:03.910
There must have been
a <i>coup</i> or something.

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:06.512
And your family was replaced.

00:11:06.512 --> 00:11:09.682
It commonly happens.

00:11:09.682 --> 00:11:11.517
You stay out of this!

00:11:11.517 --> 00:11:15.054
Hmm, Jurai's royal family is now out, huh?

00:11:15.054 --> 00:11:18.257
They say when dynasties fall, heads will roll.

00:11:18.257 --> 00:11:20.326
They do not.

00:11:20.326 --> 00:11:25.059
Don't get depressed.
Life in a cell isn't that bad.

00:11:33.339 --> 00:11:36.676
Ah, she's the most
wanted space pirate, Ryoko.

00:11:36.676 --> 00:11:37.977
Huh?

00:11:37.977 --> 00:11:42.415
- Yeah, she sure is the space pirate!
- Huh?

00:11:42.415 --> 00:11:46.686
So, Ryoko was also arrested by Jurai's military.

00:11:46.686 --> 00:11:50.884
Up against the military,
even Ryoko couldn't get away.

00:12:03.503 --> 00:12:04.970
Oh, I know.

00:12:20.353 --> 00:12:22.388
Hello, somebody?! Anybody!

00:12:22.388 --> 00:12:24.457
Whom do you think I am?

00:12:24.457 --> 00:12:27.226
Treating the crown princess
of Jurai's royal family like this!

00:12:27.226 --> 00:12:30.797
You will pay for this, you know!

00:12:30.797 --> 00:12:34.367
Ryo-Ohki, can you hear me? Ryo-Ohki?

00:12:34.367 --> 00:12:36.069
Get me out of here now!

00:12:36.069 --> 00:12:38.037
Or you shall be severely punished!

00:12:38.037 --> 00:12:40.907
- Hey, somebody!
- Arrgg!

00:12:40.907 --> 00:12:42.341
Keep it down, will you?!

00:12:42.341 --> 00:12:44.410
I'm trying to contact Ryo-Ohki here.

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:46.646
I can't concentrate at all
with you screaming like that!

00:12:46.646 --> 00:12:50.716
This cell is where you belong!
What are you complaining about?

00:12:50.716 --> 00:12:54.687
How did this all happen?

00:12:54.687 --> 00:12:58.589
I have absolutely no idea.

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:08.034
Since Jurai's military is involved, there must
have been some incident on the Planet Jurai.

00:13:08.034 --> 00:13:09.469
I hope not.

00:13:09.469 --> 00:13:12.939
I know! It's because you are
so unpopular among Juraians.

00:13:12.939 --> 00:13:14.207
What are you talking about?

00:13:14.207 --> 00:13:16.275
Listen to me.

00:13:16.275 --> 00:13:20.446
Jurai's royal family is of good lineage
and the people just adore us so much.

00:13:20.446 --> 00:13:23.316
Enough about that!
What's gonna happen to us now?

00:13:23.316 --> 00:13:25.618
When you are charged with high
treason the most common sentence

00:13:25.618 --> 00:13:29.422
would be capital punishment, wouldn't it?

00:13:29.422 --> 00:13:35.486
Ahh, if your case goes to trial, you won't
get away with a mere 700 years in prison!

00:13:38.998 --> 00:13:41.334
- Hey! Who's in charge here?!
- Ryo-Ohki, come quickly!

00:13:41.334 --> 00:13:42.869
- Ryo-Ohki!
- Bring me the person who
is responsible around here!

00:13:42.869 --> 00:13:44.337
Can't you hear me?

00:13:44.337 --> 00:13:49.509
- Let me out of here!
- Arrg! I told you to keep it down, didn't I?

00:13:49.509 --> 00:13:53.846
We have taken the princesses,
Ayeka and Sasami, into custody.

00:13:53.846 --> 00:13:58.217
As we planned, we will
join the fleet at 34:00 hours.

00:13:58.217 --> 00:14:02.455
Well done. Yosho will be
very happy to hear that.

00:14:02.455 --> 00:14:03.523
Admiral?

00:14:03.523 --> 00:14:04.924
What is it?

00:14:04.924 --> 00:14:06.726
It's about your plan.

00:14:06.726 --> 00:14:08.895
Why did the Council...

00:14:08.895 --> 00:14:13.766
We soldiers simply have
to obey orders, Captain.

00:14:13.766 --> 00:14:16.636
You don't need to think about anything else.

00:14:16.636 --> 00:14:18.501
Uh, understood, Sir.

00:14:20.840 --> 00:14:25.244
Captain, an unidentified flying
object is approaching us from Earth.

00:14:25.244 --> 00:14:26.438
What?

00:14:31.851 --> 00:14:34.954
It appears to be a patrol
ship of the Galaxy Police.

00:14:34.954 --> 00:14:38.117
It must those police that
were with Princess Ayeka.

00:14:38.958 --> 00:14:42.962
I am a Galaxy Police officer
assigned to the solar system area.

00:14:42.962 --> 00:14:48.868
As I informed you, we are
following Planet Jurai's direct orders.

00:14:48.868 --> 00:14:51.671
The Galaxy Police shouldn't interfere.

00:14:51.671 --> 00:14:54.407
This is our area of jurisdiction.

00:14:54.407 --> 00:14:57.577
The space pirate Ryoko is a wanted criminal.

00:14:57.577 --> 00:14:59.579
We request that you at
least hand her over to us.

00:14:59.579 --> 00:15:01.614
Inside this battleship is Jurai's territory.

00:15:01.614 --> 00:15:05.117
Since Ryoko was arrested on board, we
will take her to the Planet Jurai for trial.

00:15:05.117 --> 00:15:09.655
It's our normal procedure.

00:15:09.655 --> 00:15:12.792
But our superiors will be upset.

00:15:12.792 --> 00:15:14.794
That patrol ship is still approaching.

00:15:14.794 --> 00:15:16.262
Halt your ship immediately!

00:15:16.262 --> 00:15:18.731
Otherwise, we will have
no choice but to attack.

00:15:18.731 --> 00:15:20.233
This is not negotiable.

00:15:20.233 --> 00:15:23.836
If you have any complaints, you'll have
to take them up with fleet headquarters.

00:15:23.836 --> 00:15:25.538
Oh, please.

00:15:25.538 --> 00:15:27.369
It's not negotiable, period!

00:15:27.873 --> 00:15:30.309
Ugh! I can't go any further.

00:15:30.309 --> 00:15:33.746
Get closer to their ship.
Just a little bit closer.

00:15:33.746 --> 00:15:36.616
The patrol ship hasn't stopped yet.

00:15:36.616 --> 00:15:38.675
Get ready to fire!

00:15:41.354 --> 00:15:43.754
Everybody, are you ready for this?

00:15:45.324 --> 00:15:49.761
This is my latest invention, everyone!

00:15:54.367 --> 00:15:55.766
What?

00:16:02.775 --> 00:16:04.443
Here it is!

00:16:04.443 --> 00:16:06.512
Huh?

00:16:06.512 --> 00:16:09.682
The door functions as a portal.

00:16:09.682 --> 00:16:11.717
What?

00:16:11.717 --> 00:16:15.855
Why didn't you use it much earlier?!

00:16:15.855 --> 00:16:19.258
Its range is only 800 meters.

00:16:19.258 --> 00:16:21.160
It doesn't work like it would in a cartoon.

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:24.096
Well, I guess we'd better hurry.

00:16:24.096 --> 00:16:25.654
Yeah!

00:16:35.041 --> 00:16:38.067
Good luck to you all!

00:16:43.582 --> 00:16:46.813
We're already in their battleship!

00:16:52.024 --> 00:16:53.592
So this is it.

00:16:53.592 --> 00:16:55.795
Kiyone, I think we're clear now.

00:16:55.795 --> 00:16:57.558
Roger.

00:17:12.044 --> 00:17:14.347
Which way should we go?

00:17:14.347 --> 00:17:16.815
Can you sense where Ryoko may be?

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:21.287
The place where they are
locked up is probably shielded.

00:17:21.287 --> 00:17:24.056
Telepathy won't work here.

00:17:24.056 --> 00:17:27.827
Then how are we gonna
find out their location?!

00:17:27.827 --> 00:17:30.596
Ah, where do you think
you are going, Grandpa?

00:17:30.596 --> 00:17:33.499
Quit wasting time. Hurry up.

00:17:33.499 --> 00:17:34.800
What?

00:17:34.800 --> 00:17:36.836
W-Wait! Hold on a minute.

00:17:36.836 --> 00:17:39.505
Are you sure that's the way?

00:17:39.505 --> 00:17:42.963
I have a hunch.

00:17:50.816 --> 00:17:52.875
We've detected intruders inside the ship!

00:17:53.819 --> 00:17:55.753
What?

00:18:38.164 --> 00:18:41.100
Way to go, Tenchi!

00:18:41.100 --> 00:18:42.795
Let's go!

00:18:51.877 --> 00:18:53.546
Hey, everyone!

00:18:53.546 --> 00:18:56.106
Huh? Tenchi!

00:18:59.718 --> 00:19:05.791
Oh, Tenchi! You are
risking your life to save me.

00:19:05.791 --> 00:19:07.693
What are you talking about?

00:19:07.693 --> 00:19:10.491
He's come to save me, idiot.

00:19:12.398 --> 00:19:17.893
Good to see you both doing well,
but how do we open this thing?

00:19:22.007 --> 00:19:24.777
This isn't getting us anywhere.

00:19:24.777 --> 00:19:27.678
Oh, well... genius to the rescue. Ryo-Ohki!

00:19:35.754 --> 00:19:38.724
That was not a smart move!

00:19:38.724 --> 00:19:40.988
Come on. Let's get inside. Hurry!

00:19:45.531 --> 00:19:46.899
Power up all gun ports!

00:19:46.899 --> 00:19:48.628
We are not letting them escape!

00:19:53.939 --> 00:19:56.703
Ryo-Ohki, let's get out of here at top speed.

00:20:07.653 --> 00:20:11.524
I hope they make it.

00:20:11.524 --> 00:20:13.392
Yeah...

00:20:13.392 --> 00:20:16.327
I wonder what's going on on Planet Jurai.

00:20:18.430 --> 00:20:22.101
Ahh, look. The Earth is just a speck now.

00:20:22.101 --> 00:20:25.404
How am I going to get to school tomorrow?

00:20:25.404 --> 00:20:28.574
I have to go to work, too.

00:20:28.574 --> 00:20:31.977
Oh, well. You just have to go with the flow.

00:20:31.977 --> 00:20:34.313
I guess.

00:20:34.313 --> 00:20:37.216
It's a good thing that
I brought our house with me.

00:20:37.216 --> 00:20:40.085
I am a noble princess.

00:20:40.085 --> 00:20:43.222
Why must I have all these troubles?

00:20:43.222 --> 00:20:46.316
Uh, Ayeka, are you all right?

00:20:51.730 --> 00:20:54.790
Farewell, Earth!

00:22:54.153 --> 00:22:57.423
Mihoshi and Kiyone return to Galaxy
Police Headquarters only to find out

00:22:57.423 --> 00:23:00.693
that the enemy has
already infiltrated the station.

00:23:00.693 --> 00:23:04.129
What happens, now that we are the
most wanted criminals in the universe?

00:23:04.129 --> 00:23:06.165
And I thought I was getting a promotion!

00:23:06.165 --> 00:23:08.100
Come on, buddies! We'll have fun together.

00:23:08.100 --> 00:23:09.968
We criminals are like brothers, you know.

00:23:09.968 --> 00:23:13.005
Ahh... what has gone wrong with my life?

00:23:13.005 --> 00:23:15.641
Next episode is: "No Need for an Escape!"

00:23:15.641 --> 00:23:18.243
We seem to have become a
bunch of Bonnie & Clydes now!

00:23:18.243 --> 00:23:20.643
It's unquestionably fast-paced!
